repository-code: "https://github.com/FaizPalwala/virtual-id-gen"
abstract: >
  A family of synthetic, identity-conditioned face datasets generated via
  InstantID + Juggernaut-XL-v9 from CC0 synthetic SFHQ seed images.  600
  synthetic identities with identity-level split isolation (retain 450 /
  test 90 / forget 60) and a sequential 15-step forgetting protocol.  Two
  releases: SFHQ-VirtualID-Bench (224x224 aligned crops, 45,000 balanced
  images) and SFHQ-VirtualID-Full (1024x1024 candidates, 51,000 images).
keywords:
